    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d373">

                <pb facs="0491" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 322.112 St8/2.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General Goding to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Consular Agent en route from Esmeraldas has investigated case of Strong, arrested
                    Manta, who was miles distant from the robbery; no evidence against them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Goding</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
